title: "Reproducibility code for the ecological consensus of published glioblastoma prognostic signatures"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ZichenSheng/gbm-signature-consensus-repro"
authors:
  - family-names: Sheng
