abstract: >-
  Study-specific Python analysis functions, frozen definitions and a synthetic example
  accompanying the manuscript Published glioblastoma prognostic signatures share an
  ecological consensus that underrepresents a driver-associated malignant-programme balance.
  The package supports selected signature scoring, consensus, reference-coordinate,
  matched-collection, recovery, driver-associated variance and ICC computations from
  independently assembled cohort inputs. Original Python code is licensed under MIT.
  Original data curation and derived aggregate outputs are licensed under CC BY 4.0,
  with upstream material subject to its source terms.
